This patch is sveltejs/kit PR A (Linear SB-2442) and PR B (SB-2443), unchanged and in that order,
as a pnpm patch for @sveltejs/kit@3.1.1, from https://github.com/jreinhold/kit:
- PR A: branch remote-client-env, commit 6751eb4f5
  ("feat: allow the client remote-function runtime to run outside a SvelteKit app"):
  set_remote_env and reset_remote_state (@sveltejs/kit/internal/client).
- PR B: branch with-request-event, commit 734de7ce7 ("feat: add `withRequestEvent` to `$app/server`").
Delete it when Kit releases these changes.

